sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent in the sandbox
    participant P as sbx proxy on the host
    participant S as Model API
    A->>P: request with a placeholder
    P->>P: host allowed? credential bound to this host?
    P->>P: put in the key from the host keychain
    P->>S: request with the real key
    S-->>P: answer
    P-->>A: answer
    Note over A: the agent never sees the key
